{"connection_id": "BC-f708f4ea0bc2b7c32d14", "ref": "SBLGNT:Matt.25.34", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "blessed inherit the kingdom", "note": "The commentary's favored group receives a divine gift and shares a destination; the king calls the blessed to inherit the kingdom prepared for them."}
{"connection_id": "BC-29cdcbaeae8fadf2e9c5", "ref": "SBLGNT:Matt.25.41", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "paralel", "basis": "cursed ones depart from the judge", "note": "The commentary uses a passive label for those upon whom wrath has fallen; here the king explicitly addresses the cursed and sends them away, making the judge's agency overt."}
