{"connection_id": "BC-0d33e270f831b4343948", "ref": "SBLGNT:Matt.25.46", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "paralel", "basis": "two final destinies", "note": "The commentary's day carries two opposite outcomes; Matthew closes the judgment scene with punishment for one group and eternal life for the other."}

