{"connection_id": "BC-d00138f9bb98ba3c1530", "ref": "WLC:Ps.77.21", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "God leads like a shepherd", "note": "The commentary describes those guided together on a path; the psalm concludes its exodus recollection with God leading his people like a flock through Moses and Aaron."}
