{"connection_id": "BC-02b42ecab6b8d245ce01", "ref": "WLC:Prov.4.18", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "righteous path as growing light", "note": "The commentary sets the path of the favored against those who go astray; Proverbs depicts the righteous path growing brighter while the next verse gives the wicked's way as darkness."}
{"connection_id": "BC-7034bf2f63fb7e707c6f", "ref": "WLC:Prov.4.18", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "bright path of the righteous", "note": "The commentary combines a favorable face with a rightly found path; Proverbs compares the righteous path to growing daylight."}
{"connection_id": "BC-372a63128caa31c13cd3", "ref": "WLC:Prov.4.19", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "wicked way as darkness", "note": "The commentary's two groups take divergent paths; Proverbs says the way of the wicked is darkness and that they do not know what makes them stumble."}
{"connection_id": "BC-9736f4055837da5f61d6", "ref": "WLC:Prov.4.19", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "dark path and stumbling", "note": "The commentary connects loss of the way with the darkened other side; Proverbs says the wicked path is darkness and its walkers do not know what makes them stumble."}
{"connection_id": "BC-8c2dfbe1c1e249a3b54a", "ref": "WLC:Prov.8.35", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "life and favor for finding wisdom", "note": "The commentary's blessing is joined to finding the right way; Proverbs says whoever finds wisdom finds life and obtains favor from YHWH."}
{"connection_id": "BC-92301fc37c16d90689c9", "ref": "WLC:Ps.1.6", "target": "sec6", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "two ways and their ends", "note": "The commentary ends with two groups on different paths; this psalm contrasts the way of the righteous, watched by the Lord, with the way of the wicked, which perishes."}
